    "body": "> ### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n> It looks as through Chrome waits to [#restore-scroll-position-data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#restore-scroll-position-data) until the intercept promise resolves, but this isn't specced anywhere.\n\nIt is spec'ed in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#navigateevent-finish (step 5)\nSeems pretty clear that scroll restoration is done after promises are fulfilled. Am I misunderstanding something?\n\n",
